  "said.features.2978d65a": "One thing. A learner is enrolled on the qualification and works through it. There is no separate layer above it.",
  "said.features.2c7fc2b4": "Programmes group what a learner works through. There is no accreditation record, curriculum or Statement of Results.",
  "said.features.9d10d101": "Two separate things. A qualification holds the accreditation and the curriculum. A programme groups what a learner works through, with or without a qualification.",
  "said.features.ba306dce": "One thing. A learner is enrolled on the qualification, which is the programme they work through.",
  "said.features.e25549fc": "Your people say study unit rather than course. The curriculum publishes modules and leaves the grouping to you, so this is your own structure. Requires a qualification at the top.",
